        <qualifiedname>endstone::PlayerCraftItemEvent::getIngredients</qualifiedname>
        <briefdescription>
<para>Gets the ingredients a single craft consumes. </para>
        </briefdescription>
        <detaileddescription>
<para><simplesect kind="note"><para>These are the items in the crafting grid where the player used one. Crafting from the recipe book never fills the grid, so the ingredients then come from the recipe instead, and an ingredient that accepts several items reports the one the recipe names rather than the one the player supplied.</para>
</simplesect>
<simplesect kind="return"><para>the ingredients the craft consumes </para>
</simplesect>
</para>
        </detaileddescription>
